[{"id":180317687,"discussion_id":"46942e28433481af6aaf75665b0bc71de209679d","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本次 PR 主要对 `aclnn_addmm.cpp` 中的算子逻辑进行了微调，涉及 `NeedEnableFp32Output` 函数调用参数扩展以及若干代码格式整理。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`NeedEnableFp32Output` 调用参数扩展**：在调用 `NeedEnableFp32Output` 时新增了 `nullptr` 和 `true` 两个实参，以适配该函数签名变更或支持新的判断逻辑。\n- **条件判断换行格式调整**：将 `CheckGemmV3WithAlphaBeta` 与 `isSupportNpuArch` 的组合条件从两行合并为一行，提升代码紧凑性。\n- **`useGemm16In32Out` 赋值语句换行调整**：将 `isSupportNpuArch` 条件从独立一行合并至上一行末尾，统一代码风格。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-16T15:38:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T15:54:28+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180317690,"discussion_id":"3283afd7fb26bd0e043c286c5c122258d57b0f56","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 结束总结\n\n本次审查覆盖了 1 个变更文件：`matmul/mat_mul_v3/op_host/op_api/aclnn_addmm.cpp`。\n\n**发现汇总：**\n- P3: 1 个（`aclnnAddmmWeightNzGetWorkspaceSize` 中 `NeedEnableFp32Output` 的 `isFusion` 参数可能与 `AddmmMatmulGraph::Impl` 不同步，存在潜在不一致）\n\n**整体风险评估：低风险。** 本次变更的核心语义改动仅是将 `AddmmMatmulGraph::Impl` 中 `NeedEnableFp32Output` 调用的 `isFusion` 参数由默认 `false` 改为显式 `true`，以支持 fusion 模式下的 FP32 输出。其余变更均为纯格式化（条件表达式换行位置调整），无语义影响。WeightNz 路径的调用点未同步更新，需作者确认是否为有意为之。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-16T15:38:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T16:07:07+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180317728,"discussion_id":"dbecb348e77236042113149bd2ee212b211c9039","body":"Thanks for your pull-requ